refused: d164_as_needs_a_group.cy:7:26, line 7 column 26
 7 |     let $s: str = $a div 3.0 as str;
   |                          ^^^^^^^^^^
 what: this `as` is mixed with other operators, so it needs `( )`
 why:  `as` works on a single value, and where maths gives no order you group with `( )` (D116)
